.SS "Parse Method Parameter Decorators (\fR#12\fP)"
.RS 4
\fRMethod Parameter Decorators\fP is now a TC39 \fRstage 0 proposal\fP\&. 
.RE
.PP

.PP
Examples:

.PP
.PP
.nf
class Foo {
  constructor(@foo() x, @bar({ a: 123 }) @baz() y) {}
}

export default function func(@foo() x, @bar({ a: 123 }) @baz() y) {}

var obj = {
  method(@foo() x, @bar({ a: 123 }) @baz() y) {}
};
.fi
.PP
.SS "Parse for-await statements (w/ \fRasyncGenerators\fP plugin) (\fR#17\fP)"
